      "side": 1,
      "message": "\"Does EC re-enable the MPU?\"\nNot sure I understand the question correctly, but it looks like MPU is re-enabled during initialization [here]( https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/common/system.c;l\u003d500). Note that this code is borrowed from zephyr [bloonchipper](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/program/fpmcu/bloonchipper/src/ec_quirks.c;l\u003d43) but happy to add a comment both places if helpful. How about adding \"EC will re-enable the MPU on boot\" after the existing comment \"after sysjump to EC.\"?",
